  /** helper function to check Recovery_Control_supervisor_process_recovery_control's
   * output ports.  Use named arguments to check subsets of the output ports.
   * @param gate_mining method that will be called with the value of the outgoing data
   *        port 'gate_mining'.
   * @param gate_defense method that will be called with the value of the outgoing data
   *        port 'gate_defense'.
   * @param gate_mobility method that will be called with the value of the outgoing data
